{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"启示录","commonName":"启示录","title":"启示录","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"a3ce0eb35f9176382260d30d0f25dc139f193a7e6e65d0e12dc07a11030bd42e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":402},"chapter":{"number":4,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["天上的敬拜"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["此后，我再观看，见天上有一扇门开了，又听见之前那个像号角般响亮的声音对我说：“你上这里来，我要把以后必发生的事指示给你看。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我便立刻被圣灵感动，看见天上安设着一个宝座，有一位坐在宝座上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["闪耀着碧玉和红宝石般的光彩。有一道翡翠般的彩虹围绕着宝座。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["宝座的周围设有二十四个座位，有二十四位长老身穿白衣，头戴金冠，坐在上面。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["从宝座发出闪电、响声、雷鸣，宝座前面燃烧着七把火炬，代表",{"noteId":10},"上帝的七灵。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["宝座前还有一个水晶般的玻璃海，宝座的四周环绕着四个活物，他们前后都长满了眼睛。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["第一个活物像狮子，第二个像牛犊，第三个有人的面孔，第四个像飞鹰。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["这四个活物各有三对翅膀，翅膀内外都长满眼睛。他们昼夜不停地说：",{"text":"“圣哉！圣哉！圣哉！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主上帝是昔在、今在、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以后永在的全能者。”","poem":1},{"noteId":11}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["每逢这些活物将荣耀、尊贵、感谢献给坐在宝座上、活到永永远远的那位时，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["二十四位长老就俯伏在坐宝座的那位面前，敬拜活到永永远远的那位，又把他们的冠冕放在宝座前，说："]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"text":"“我们的主，我们的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你配得荣耀、尊贵和权能，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你创造了万物，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"万物都因你的旨意被创造而存在。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":10,"caller":"+","text":"“代表”希腊文是“就是”。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":5}},{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"以赛亚书6:3。","reference":{"chapter":4,"verse":8}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/4.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/5.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/REV/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}